commenti.body:
I never watched any Noe films before a movie marathon first date with a girl I liked a lot, it was her idea. Theatre had Vortex, Lux Aeterna, Irreversible twice(once as it is and then in reverse...) and Climax.  I liked them overall, except Irreversible which left me very angry, Climax however really hit me. Visuals, sounds, mesmerizing dance scenes, the way shit hits the fan and doesnt't let up until the end, I loved all of it.

&#x200B;

I watched Enter the Void later and would put it at the top of my Gasper list but Climax will be a yearly watch like Mad Max Fury Road.
